      "content": "it's just... it's exhausting. like i'm a ghost in my own life. everyone's talking about \"finding new purpose\" or \"moving on\" but how do you move on when there's literally nothing solid to stand on? it feels like the universe itself is just void. why should i keep struggling to find something that probably doesn't even exist?",
